{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>You stretched out Your right hand.</b> What is the wonder, that Your name is supreme above the supernal ones, and from there You stretched out Your right hand, and the earth, which is below all lowly things, swallowed the enemy. Behold, by way of parable: in a single moment Your right hand, which is above the heavens of heavens, reached beneath the sea." "And the meaning of \"Your right hand\" is Your power."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:34:44.341714886Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}